~ start
NONI: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Kuya Ollie![/wave] There's no school tomorrow but why's everyone acting so weird?

NONI: We don't have to go to school, right? So we can play in the rain and catch frogs! [wave amp=2 freq=3]Can we, Kuya?[/wave]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0]Did you put your slippers away? Make sure you can find them, okay?[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Oh! Right! I'll find them! I won't lose them this time![/wave]

NONI: [speed=0.8]Kuya...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0]Hmm?[/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.9]The lady on TV said the big storm is coming on your birthday. Will it go away by morning?[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.0]Nanay said she'll still make your favorite cake though! And Tatay said the coconut trees will protect our house! [wave amp=1 freq=2]The rain can't get us if the trees are there![/wave]

NONI: [speed=0.8]Your birthday will still be fun, right, Kuya?[/speed]

=> END